{"id":"8ef41dbc67d42602","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-jep-characterization.md","title":"thm-jep-characterization","display":"thm-jep-characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-jep]]","[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"],"display":"thm-jep-characterization","label":"93-thm-jep-characterization","aliases":["93-thm-jep-characterization"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e659db66dc4dd9b2\" href=\"?note=e659db66dc4dd9b2\" title=\"93-df-jep\">93-df-jep</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jep-characterization"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-jep-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-jep-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-jep-characterization-thm-jep-characterization\">thm-jep-characterization <code>thm-jep-characterization</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JEP}\">\\(\\mathrm{JEP}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e659db66dc4dd9b2\" href=\"?note=e659db66dc4dd9b2\" title=\"93-df-jep\">93-df-jep</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jep\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{JEP}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\exists e_A,e_B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_A,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_B,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jep\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{JEP}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\exists e_A,e_B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_A,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_B,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Joint embedding and amalgamation are distinct properties; neither is equivalent to the other for an arbitrary generated variety.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-jep-characterization-thm-jep-characterization","text":"thm-jep-characterization `thm-jep-characterization`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","le